Hello <%= @recipient.first_name %>,

<% case @event_name %>
<% when "booking.requested" %>
<%= @actor&.first_name || "A passenger" %> has requested a seat on your ride.
<% when "booking.accepted" %>
Great news! Your seat request has been confirmed by the driver.
<% when "booking.canceled" %>
A booking on your ride has been canceled.
<% when "ride.canceled" %>
An upcoming ride you booked has been canceled by the driver.
<% when "incident.resolved" %>
A decision has been reached regarding your reported incident on Pasabaya.
<% else %>
You have a new update regarding your trip on Pasabaya.
<% end %>

Visit Pasabaya to check the latest updates: <%= root_url %>
